      "title": "How to use",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Qwen-Image 2.1 - text to image\n\n1. Write your prompt in **Text Encode Qwen Image 2.1**.\n2. Size in **Empty Latent Image**: 1024x1024 (fast) or up to 2048x2048 (native 2K, slower).\n3. Click **Run**.\n\n**Settings:** euler + simple, 25 steps (40-50 = Qwen's own pipeline), **CFG 1** - the negative prompt is only used when CFG is above 1.\n\n**Text in the image:** put it in double quotes.\n\n**Transparent PNG:** This is an RGBA format image with transparency. *your subject*. The image has an alpha channel and a transparent background."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Qwen-Image 2.1 - text to image\n\n1. Write your prompt in **Text Encode Qwen Image 2.1**.\n2. Size in **Empty Latent Image**: 1024x1024 (fast) or up to 2048x2048 (native 2K, slower).\n3. Click **Run**.\n\n**Settings:** euler + simple, 25 steps (40-50 = Qwen's own pipeline), **CFG 1** - the negative prompt is only used when CFG is above 1.\n\n**Text in the image:** put it in double quotes.\n\n**Transparent PNG:** This is an RGBA format image with transparency. *your subject*. The image has an alpha channel and a transparent background."
      },
